      "content": "thanks. i was worried about it because i read something online about mixing meds but you seem sure. i'm mostly just worried about breathing heavy or feeling too out of it in the morning. is it common for people to take both? also, how much benadryl should i take with the hydrocodone so i dont wake up feeling like a zombie?",
